# Global Fuel Prices and Taxation Trends

## Project Overview

This project analyzes global fuel prices and taxation trends using Tableau dashboards and data visualization.

## Objectives

* Compare fuel prices across countries.
* Explore differences in fuel taxation.
* Identify patterns and trends in the available data.
* Present insights through charts and dashboards.

## Tools Used

* Tableau
* CSV Dataset
* GitHub

## Project Workflow

1. Collect the fuel price dataset.
2. Review and prepare the data.
3. Create charts in Tableau.
4. Combine charts into a dashboard.
5. Analyze findings and document conclusions.

